    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Business conference hall with rostrum and empty projection screen. Shallow DOF, selective focus. [url=http://www.istockphoto.com/file_search.php?action=file&amp;lightboxID=4755063][img]http://santoriniphoto.com/Template-Business.jpg[/img][/url]&#xA;&#xA;[url=http://www.istockphoto.com/file_search.php?action=file&amp;lightboxID=4755063][img]http://santoriniphoto.com/Template-Business.jpg[/img][/url]</rdf:li>
